Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.04,0:19:05.87,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&3A3E42\4c&3A3E42}我能扮演費倫的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:05.87,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&3A3E42\4c&3A3E42}フェルンの親代わりになることを望んでいたみたいだけれども
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.63,0:19:11.96,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&3A3E42\4c&3A3E42}到頭來 卻連她喜歡什麼都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:11.96,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&3A3E42\4c&3A3E42}私は結局あの子の好きなものをほとんど見つけられなかった
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.55,0:19:23.68,Dial-CHI,,1111,0,0,,{\c&EDF3FF}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&262626\4c&262626}但妳不是記得很清楚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:23.68,Dial-JPN,,1111,0,0,,{\c&EDF3FF}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&262626\4c&262626}でも　こうしてちゃんと覚えているじゃねえか
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.14,0:19:27.85,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7\c&F5FBFF}我想妳有好好扮演費倫的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:27.85,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7\c&F5FBFF}フリーレンは多分　ちゃんと親をやれてるよ
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.98,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7\c&F5FBFF}說起來 踏上旅途後
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.98,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7\c&F5FBFF}そういえば　旅に出て
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.98,0:19:37.91,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7\c&F5FBFF}第一次為費倫慶生 也是在這樣的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:37.91,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7\c&F5FBFF}初めてフェルンの誕生日を祝ったのもこんな所だったっけ
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.49,0:19:45.25,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7}{\3c&526087\4c&526087}你偶爾也會說些不錯的話嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:45.25,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7}{\3c&526087\4c&526087}たまには　シュタルクもいいことを言うね
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.96,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7}{\3c&526087\4c&526087}對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.96,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\blur0.7}{\3c&526087\4c&526087}だろ
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.75,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&58738C\4c&58738C}我原諒你一次 計數也減少一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.75,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&58738C\4c&58738C}カウントを１回分戻してあげよう
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.80,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&58738C\4c&58738C}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.80,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&58738C\4c&58738C}ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.57,0:20:23.91,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}芙莉蓮大人 有人邀請我去約會
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:23.91,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}フリーレン様　デートに誘われてしまいました
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.87,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}我該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.87,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}どうすれば
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.75,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}費倫也要來找我商量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.75,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}こっちもか
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.42,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.42,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}いや　何でもないよ
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.09,0:20:37.38,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}老師 您約過會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:37.38,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}フリーレン様はデートをしたことはありますか
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.63,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}約過
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.63,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}あるよ
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.63,0:20:40.14,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:40.14,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}ですよね
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.80,0:20:43.89,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}您約過會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:43.89,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8F0FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&323438\4c&323438}あるんですか
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.02,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.02,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}うん
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.35,0:20:51.86,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}您是和是誰一起 去做什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:51.86,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}デートって　誰と何をされたのですか
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.44,0:20:56.15,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}和欣梅爾一起去找迷路的小貓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:56.15,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}ヒンメルと一緒に迷い猫捜しに出掛けた
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.70,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}是魔法道具店的店主拜託的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.70,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}魔導具店の店主に頼まれてね
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.36,0:21:03.53,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}那僅僅是在完成委託吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:03.53,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}それって　依頼をこなしただけですよね
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.53,0:21:07.25,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}那能算是約會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:07.25,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E6F0FF}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&27282B\4c&27282B}それは　デートと呼べるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.42,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}費倫 妳聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.42,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}あのね　フェルン
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.83,0:21:16.13,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}了解彼此的異性 兩人一起外出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:16.13,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}気心の知れた異性と２人きりで出掛けたら
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.55,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}這就是約會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.55,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}それはデートになるんだよ
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.18,0:21:23.43,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}師父是這麼告訴我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:23.43,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E3EBFA\bord1.7\blur0.7\3c&2F3340\4c&2F3340}って　師匠が言ってた
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.68,0:21:29.77,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}這麼說 我和贊恩也約過會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:29.77,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}そういえばザインともデートしたな
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.06,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.06,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&D3DEF0}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&060708\4c&060708}もういいです
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.07,0:21:37.65,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&EBF3FF\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&262626\4c&262626}晚安
